repository-code: "https://github.com/srijansk/crewlore"
url: "https://github.com/srijansk/crewlore"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-23
abstract: >-
  An open, local-first compiler that turns AI-coding-agent sessions and
  agent-authored pull-request threads into a versioned, plaintext, citable
  team-knowledge layer in the team's own git repository. Every compiled claim
  carries a verbatim anchor back to the source it came from.
keywords:
  - agent-memory
  - tribal-knowledge
  - coding-agents
  - knowledge-compilation
  - provenance
